  "summary": "What I do\n\nI help leaders and organizations unlock high performance. \nMy work turns cutting-edge team research into pragmatic, impactful results.\nI work with companies that want real transformation, stronger leadership, and results that last.\n\n\nWhat makes me different\n\nI combine degrees in engineering, psychology, and economics with an award-winning PhD on how agile teams succeed under uncertainty. My deep knowledge meets many years of experience as a leader, manager, and founder.\n\nI co-authored Micro Habits for Better Teamwork — small, actionable recipes for big results. I design Enabling Structures that make excellent teamwork measurable and effective.\n\n👉 enablingstructures.com — let’s talk.",
